\id PSA - Psalm 23 translated (Kathy Glasgow) and consultant checked (Paulus Kieviet) 2022 
\h Psalms 
\toc1 Manakay 
\toc2 Psalms 
\toc3 Psalms 
\mt1 Manakay  
\c 23  
\s1 An-ngaypa An-gata Jaga A-ganaja Apula A-workiya  
\p
\v 1 Wangarr an-gata ay-ninyarrapa ay-workiya nipa an-ngaypa jaga a-ganaja apula a-workiya.  
\p Gala gun-nga barrwa jal ngu-ni.   
\p
\v 2 Nipa nguna-ganyja gun-molamola gu-rrawa balaja gu-murna.  
\p Nguna-gurdagurdarraja bugula warlwarl gu-werrwerrjinga gu-bamburda barra ngu-bay.   
\p
\v 3 Wolawola ngu-nyarlkuch ngu-nirra, nipa a-gunggajinga apula a-workiya, ngu-molamola ngu-ninyarra.  
\p Nipa mu-ngoyurra a-bamburda a-workiya, jarlakarr gun-molamola gu-mangga a-workiya barra ngaypa ngu-jurrjurrma rrapa aburr-werranga abi-na nipa an-molamola.   
\b  
\q1
\v 4 Wuriya ngu-bamba an-munya gu-mayana gu-ji,  
\q2 gun-gujuwa yi-gurrepa,  
\q2 wurra ngaypa gala barra ng-gurkuja.  
\q1 Wurra nginyipa wugupa apula.  
\q1 Gun-nginyipa gun-gugarlakarlaja gu-guyinda  
\q2 nginyipa jechinawa jechinawa nguna-nenga ny-yorkiya,  
\q2 ngaypa ngu-bamburda,  
\q2 rrapa ny-jorlkakaja apula ny-yorkiya.  
\q1 Gun-narda ngaypa ngu-borrwuja ngu-workiya, rrapa ngu-nyiljinga.   
\b  
\p
\v 5 Aburr-gata mari gubi-rrimanga apula aburr-workiya, birripa ngunabi-nacha nginyipa nawanawa nyi-nirra apula ny-yorkiya janara.  
\p Nginyipa ny-jonyjinga apula, rrapa bama ngu-jirra nguna-gurragaja woyil (oil) ana-guyinda, ganyjarr minypa nguna-wucha.  
\p An-ngaypa mernda a-jirra ngana gu-mayana gun-molamola gun-gunyilja nginyipa ny-borrwurra apula.   
\p
\v 6 Ganapiya. Ngaypa wuparnana ng-galiyarra rrapa marn.gi ngu-nirra nginyipa wugupa apula ngorrngurra gun-bulapalawa gu-yinmiyapa gu-yurra apula.  
\p Ngardawa nginyipa ny-jurdiya ny-molamola. Gurrurta n-dimahga, rrapa gala ny-yinmiya ny-bamapa apula.  
\p Gun-burral!  
\p Wangarr an-gata ay-nyinyarrapa ay-workiya nipa ana-murna ngaypa ngu-nipa barra ngu-workiya.   